{"sourceUrl":"https://wgyxy.hhu.edu.cn/2025/0620/c6684a304678/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:05.099382+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://wgyxy.hhu.edu.cn/2025/0620/c6684a304678/page.htm","html":"<div><div><p></p><div><p><br/></p></div><p><span>河海大学</span><span><span>外国语学院</span></span><span><span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span>年全国优秀大学生</span><span><span>校园开放日及</span></span><span>有关安排的通知</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>河海大学外国语学院前身为</span></span><span><span>1987</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年创办的外语系，</span></span><span><span>1995</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年与社科系、法律系等组建人文学院，</span></span><span><span>2002</span></span></span></span><span><span>年成立外国语学院。现拥有</span></span><a href=\"https://wgyxy.hhu.edu.cn/2025/0620/c6684a304678/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">发布</a><span><span>外国语言文学一级学科硕士学位授权点、翻译硕士学位授权点，英语本科专业、法语本科专业</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>英语第二学士学位专业</span></span><span><span>和“全球胜任力与数字生态文明建设”微专业</span></span><span><span>。英语专业入选国家一流本科专业建设点和江苏省品牌专业。西非国家经济共同体研究中心获教育部国别与区域研究基地备案。</span></span></p><p><span><span>为让更多优秀考生更深入地了解我院特色与优势，各学科实力、师资力量、研究生教育情况和研究生招生信息等，我院将于</span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span>月</span><span><span>5-6</span></span></span><span>日期间举办校园开放日活动。活动期间，我院将进行研究生招生政策宣讲、与导师面对面交流互动等活动，提供详尽的报考信息和指导。欢迎有意向报考我院研究生的同学前来参加，现将有关事项通知如下。</span></p><p><span><span><strong>一、活动</strong></span></span><span><strong>规模及</strong></span><span><span><strong>活动对象</strong></span></span></p><p><span>本次</span><span><span>活动规模</span></span><span>拟</span><span><span><span><span>定</span></span><span><span>30</span></span></span></span><span>名左右，具体专业详见报名系统，</span><span><span>报名</span></span><span>条件如下：</span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span>具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span>高水平大学或设有特色专业全日制高校的本科三年级在校生（</span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span>届毕业生）。</span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span>有意来河海大学求学深造，对所报专业有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事相关学术研究或实践工作。</span></p><p><span><strong>二、报名时间及方式</strong></span></p><p><span><span>请有意向申请我院</span><span><span>校园开放日</span></span><span>的同学于北京时间</span></span><span><span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span>年</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>20</span></span><span>日</span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span><span>:00—202</span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>日</span><span><span><span><span>17</span></span><span>:00</span></span></span><span><span>，</span><span>在河海大学研究生招</span><span>生管理系统（考生端）（</span></span><span><a href=\"http://yzss.hhu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yzss.hhu.edu.cn/</a></span><span><span>）中，招生项目选择“全国优秀大学生</span><span><span>校园开放日</span></span><span>”进行注册、登录和信息填报（具体操作详见系统提示），不在规定时间内填报的所有报名信息均无效。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>三、材料提交与确认</strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span>参加我院</span><span><span>校园开放日</span></span><span>的</span><span><span>同学</span></span><span>，需提供以下材料</span><span><strong>（</strong></span><span><strong>请按照顺序扫描成</strong></span></span><span><strong>PDF</strong></span><span><span><strong>文件，汇总生成一个压缩包，命名方式：</strong></span><span><span><strong>报名</strong></span></span><span><strong>专业</strong></span></span><span><strong>_</strong></span><span><span><span><strong>报名</strong></span></span><span><strong>姓名</strong></span></span><span><strong>_</strong></span><span><span><span><strong>校园开放日报名</strong></span></span><span><strong>材料</strong></span></span><span><strong>.ZIP</strong></span><span><span><strong>，上传至报名系统）</strong></span><span>。</span><span>参加现场活动时</span><span><span>请</span></span><span>携带</span><span>身份证、学生证、学校教务部门盖章成绩单（含总评成绩、排名）</span><span><strong>原件备查</strong></span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）“</span><span><span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span>年全国优秀大学生</span><span><span>校园开放日报名登记</span></span><span>表”</span></span><span>1</span><span>份（请至报名系统生成和下载）。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>）身份证、学生证复印件。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>）前两年半成绩单与总评成绩、排名证明</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>）学术或科研成果、各类获奖证书扫描件各</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>）国家英语四、六级考试成绩，或</span><span><span>IELTS/TOEFL</span></span><span>成绩，或</span><span><span>GRE/GMAT</span></span><span>成绩等体现自身外语水平的证明材料</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>份。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>）</span><span><span>其他能证明个人能力的材料。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>我院将对提交</span><span><span>的</span></span><span>报名信息进行审核后确定</span><span><span>入围开放日活动对象</span></span><span>。请提交报名申请的同学于北京时间</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>11:00</span></span><span><span>前</span><span><span>登录报名系统</span></span><span>查询审核状态，入围者请于北京时间</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>11:00</span></span><span>前，在报名系统中点击确认参加，逾期未确认参加者视作放弃。</span></p><p><span><strong>四、活动方式及具体安排</strong></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><strong>序号</strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong>时间</strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong>内容</strong></span></p></td><td><p><span><strong>备注</strong></span><span><span><strong></strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>15:00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>开放日</span></span><span>报到</span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>提交报名材料</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>行政楼</span><span><span>621</span></span><span>室</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>2</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>9:00</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>学院开幕式</span><span><br/></span></span><span><span>学院及学科情况介绍</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>行政楼</span><span><span>602</span></span><span>室</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>3</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><br/>9:30</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span>名师报告：水电大坝如何塑造地缘政治格局 </span></p></td><td><p><span>行政楼</span><span><span>602</span></span><span>室</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>4</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><br/>10:30</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span>名师报告：讲故事干预下农村留守儿童的叙事能力发展与评估</span></p></td><td><p><span>行政楼</span><span><span>602</span></span><span>室</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>5</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><br/>11:30</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span>校园文化介绍</span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>6</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>日</span><span><span>13:30</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>优秀毕业生代表分享</span></p></td><td><p><span>行政楼</span><span><span>602</span></span><span>室</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>7</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><br/>14:30</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span>行业导师报告：语言服务行业生态与管理</span></p></td><td><p><span>行政楼</span><span><span>602</span></span><span>室</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>8</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><br/>15:30</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>名师报告：外国文学跨界研究</span></span><span><span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span>行政楼</span><span><span>602</span></span><span>室</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>9</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><br/>16:30</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span>导师团队圆桌派对</span></p></td><td><p><span>行政楼</span><span><span>602</span></span><span>室</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span><strong>五</strong></span></span><span><strong>、其他</strong></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>其他未尽事宜请参见学院官网通知</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>最终招生学院、专业、方向和导师以</span><span><span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span>年博士、硕士研究生招生简章</span><span><span>和专业</span></span><span>目录公布信息为准。</span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span>开放日</span></span><span>待遇：</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span></span><span>）差旅、食宿：</span><span>提供校园开放日期间在南京的食宿（本校和南京本地学生住宿自理），交通均自理。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span></span><span>）保险：学院将为</span><span><span>参加校园开放日的同学</span></span><span>购买</span><span><span>开放日</span></span><span>间人身意外伤害保险。</span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span><span>.</span></span></span><span>联系方式：</span></p><p><span>联系人：</span><span><span>钱老师</span></span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span><span>025-58099462</span></span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：</span><span><span>wyyym@hhu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span>通信地址：江苏省南京市江宁区佛城西路</span><span><span>8</span></span><span>号河海大学行政</span><span><span>楼</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>外国语</span></span><span>学院</span></p><p><span><span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span>月</span><span><span>19</span></span><span>日</span></p><div><p><span></span></p><p><br/></p><br/><p><br/></p></div><p><br/></p></div></div>","textSha256":"86e38102160b281aadd20a35ab04f407c6240141cc309527a1c84ba188a7599c","textLength":1673,"sourceSha256":"1261f5dd9522a1ba8d13d12e62ae4dc1a140febe1742df2636feb3dd397daea3","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4c16b4409bb7c1099c19","title":"2025年河海大学外国语学院2025年全国优秀大学生校园开放日及有关安排的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:05.099382+00:00"}
